@node Board Sections and Folding
@subsection Board Sections and Folding
@cindex folding a board section
@kindex SPC

Each section heading is a thing carrying a toggle (@pxref{One Movement
Scheme}).  @kbd{SPC} on a heading folds or unfolds that section; @kbd{+}
and @kbd{-} expand and collapse, and @kbd{*} toggles everything.  Section
state is remembered per store, so reopening the board restores your
layout.

@node Ready and Blocked Lists
@subsection Ready and Blocked Lists
@cindex ready issues
@cindex blocked issues

The @emph{ready} list is the work frontier: issues that are open and have
no unmet dependencies.  The @emph{blocked} list is its complement: issues
waiting on dependencies or on a declared blocked status.  Open them from
the dispatch menu with @kbd{r} and @kbd{b}, or from the board header.

